AlgorithmRun "1" *-- "2..*" Step : immutable snapshots
KnowledgeCard "0..*" --> "1" SourceReference : source
Exercise "1" --> "0..*" AnswerRecord : attempts
LearningRecord "1" o-- "0..*" AnswerRecord : local history
AnswerRecord "0..*" ..> "0..1" Step : optional run context
AgentCoordinator ..> RunStateService : read only
RunStateService ..> AlgorithmRun : lookup runId stepIndex
AgentCoordinator ..> KnowledgeRetriever : retrieve checked cards
KnowledgeRetriever ..> KnowledgeCard : evidence
Exercise ..> KnowledgeCard : sourceRefs
